 ore (best heard on the 1987 album Right Now!)\, whose raw\, purposefully o
 ff-putting style and deliberately offensive lyrics made them one of the mo
 st polarizing bands of the day. After Pussy Galore's breakup\, Spencer lau
 nched the Jon Spencer Blues Explosion\, whose frantic but wildly energetic
